        "text": "#### **[11] OpenAI's Astra Model Uses \"Recurrent Depth\" Technique**\n* **What is confirmed:** *The Information* reports that OpenAI's upcoming \"Astra\" AI model utilizes a technique called \"recurrent depth\" (looping layers / latent space reasoning) to boost performance and cut inference costs"
